    {
        "text": "A beetle flies through the dark alley."
    },
    {
        "text": "It flaps its wings furiously, but only manages to find its way into an abandoned block that few souls tread anymore."
    },
    {
        "text": "Its golden body is too heavy, weighed down even further by the gems on its wings. It can only fly a short distance before coming to a rest in a gap between the stone tiles\u2014"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
