        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "The Bureaucrat tucks away the parasite, while The Officer eagerly watches the crystal tears drop again and again."
    },
    {
        "text": "The Ombudsman brusquely manhandles the cloudbeast, while The Torturer raises the sword as though it conferred power over life and death."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "fadetime": 2,
        "channel": "bgs"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#13$2",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#13$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What a lively scene.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#1$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "All of this treasure is yours, my servants.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am not so miserly as to withhold them after seeing how much you love them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "But what more do you intend to take from me, once I have given you these?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#6$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me guess...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
