        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A path appears at the dead end of the alley, and even more shiny baubles rush towards it."
    },
    {
        "text": "There is no time to bother with what is already in their hands."
    },
    {
        "text": "They scramble for the treasure on the ground, stuffing it into their pockets, carrying it on their backs, and rushing towards the next shiny piece before even standing back up from the last one."
    },
    {
        "text": "None of them care where the path leads."
    },
    {
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Bureaucrat'"
    },
    {
        "text": "...going to Dossoles tomorrow... It's high time I treated myself to something nice...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Bureaucrat'"
    },
    {
        "text": "...squeeze these country bumpkins in Na Saoirs\u00ed a little more...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Cruel Officer'"
    },
    {
        "text": "...don't forget my share...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Ombudsman'"
    },
    {
        "text": "...can't wait for the townsfolk to send me some 'Victorian spies'...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Torturer'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "My, my. After far more than just wealth, aren't we?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "A life of luxury. A high status. Power over life and death. You want it all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have nothing against being true to your desires. And what you desire are things that I will not miss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "Unfortunately, you happen to be my servants, yet you seem far greedier than I.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "So goodbye. Go to where you belong.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "The treasures pave a shiny path where none existed, sending the madmen out of the Lair and out onto the land..."
    },
    {
        "text": "Towards whence the darkness came, the gaping mouth of the Dark Woods."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
