    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1694_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "So what was wrong with Emma?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1694_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just a cold, on top of mild malnutrition.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "She didn't look so bad on the outskirts of the Dark Woods.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1694_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...A sickness of the spirit, most likely.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Iron for the statue needed to be collected from door to door. People won't even turn on their lamps to save fuel, never mind food...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "What could she possibly be shipping out?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "She runs a grain store. Maybe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1694_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "But only a grain store. She couldn't have done this on her own. There must be somebody behind her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "We also still need to ask about Theo. There's no time to wait for her to come to on her own.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh\u2014agh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can you hear me, Emma?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ni\u2014Niels!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take me with you... take me with you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1694_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, she's still dreaming.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Niels... is that somebody's name?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've seen it written on letters she's gotten. A loved one, if I had to guess.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1694_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And where might we find them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No idea. It's been a while since the last letter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Niels...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "Scold me, beat me if you must... but don't abandon me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Bureaucrat told me to smuggle food, so I did... What meaning is there in a life without you? What point is there in being kind to others?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1694_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Bureaucrat... Dublinn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's so much food in the city. A single cart won't make a difference...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no food in the city. A single cart won't make a difference...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "Won't make a difference...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Should we keep trying to wake her up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1694_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Why wasn't it you who lived?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those accursed Victorians... Why did <i>their</i> child live?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1694_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "A child... of Victorians?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh... uh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "It'll be alright, my dear\u2014I'll make things right\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait for me, Niels... Wait for me, my love...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sob*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sob*... *sob*...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't see you, my love! I can't see you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Why? Why?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Victorians who killed you have been chased out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "The last Victorian bastard died... before my eyes...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "Niels...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sweat fills Emma's fevered brow. Tormented by nightmares, she instinctively grabs the sheets beneath her, but it does not stop her from trembling."
    },
    {
        "text": "The other two stand up at the same time."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
