    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "59_g2_citystreets_n",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$darkness_03_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1694_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's already past curfew. Will we really able to move freely?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1694_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stick with me. If the mist wants to take either of us, let it try.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, someone's coming over from the citadel!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1694_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like Dublinn. It's...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_723_1#6$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1694_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Brigadier!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_723_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Brigadier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's going on? It's like he's a walking ghost...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Brigadier!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_723_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who's there?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Brigadier"
    },
    {
        "text": "Loughshinny?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Brigadier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go back, now, back to...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Brigadier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1694_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What happened?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_723_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Brigadier"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing happened tonight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Brigadier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Brigadier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1694_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We have a lead on the food shortage, sir.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "The owner of this grain store was instructed by The Bureaucrat to smuggle food out of Na Saoirs\u00ed. We may be able to get it back, if we're quick.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_723_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Bureaucrat? I should have known\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Brigadier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it's too late. Everything's too late.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Brigadier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1694_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why? Do you know where the food went?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_723_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not the food...",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "The Brigadier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Me. Us.",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "The Brigadier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you for informing me, but I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Brigadier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1694_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is going on? Tell me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, nothing happened tonight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Brigadier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1694_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't imagine what could have turned you... a warrior with no qualms about killing for the greater good, into... this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you and Dublinn found this nation over the corpses of so many, just to starve your own people to death here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_723_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Brigadier"
    },
    {
        "text": "No. Never.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Brigadier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you for informing me. I will... deal with it, personally.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Brigadier"
    },
    {
        "text": "But do not mention the name Dublinn ever again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Brigadier"
    },
    {
        "text": "You got your promise. Do not set foot on the streets again tonight, and especially do not break curfew with someone insignificant, as you're doing now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Brigadier"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is for your own good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Brigadier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_openftstpwalk",
        "volume": 1,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "o"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "o",
        "fadetime": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Loughshinny opens her mouth to speak, but The Brigadier shows no acknowledgment."
    },
    {
        "text": "He turns around and walks towards the outskirts of the city with heavy, dragging steps."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1694_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are we gonna do as he says? Hide?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1694_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...No, Nemos needs to know about Theo. Do you know where she lives?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a wee bit far, practically the other side of Na Saoirs\u00ed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1694_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then that's where we're going.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
