    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1694_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nemos's house is just ahead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "text": "That was easy. Seems the mist didn't get into the city tonight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$doorknockquite",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nemos? Are you home?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$doorknockquite",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nemos?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, didn't she say she'd be at the Dublinn victory party? Is she not back yet?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1694_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Brigadier was leaving the citadel. The party should be over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#6$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Loughshinny... Brigid?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Loughshinny is about to speak when her gaze meets Nemos's."
    },
    {
        "text": "Her eyes are even blanker than the Brigadier's were."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1694_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's going on? Did something happen at the victory party?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, nothing happened tonight...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you two doing here?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "text": "Quick, inside! You mustn't be out on the streets tonight!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
