    {
        "text": "The next day, the city gets the smallest of reprieves from the food shortage. No one notices that The Brigadier never returned from the Dark Woods."
    },
    {
        "text": "The food mysteriously appear at the agricultural plate before making its way to the grain stores across the city. It falls well short of truly solving the problem."
    },
    {
        "text": "But it was far more than just The Brigadier who never came back, though the people of the city do not know it yet."
    },
    {
        "text": "Once again the sun rises, without pity or care."
    },
    {
        "text": "The dragon and the wayward wakewoman walk the streets, watching with shock at how the now-commonplace brawls descend into even more brutal violence."
